RAE 2822, Two-Dimensional Transonic Turbulent Flow
M_infty = 0.729, alpha = 2.31 deg.
369 x 65, C-grid.  raetaf.dat

freestream static 0.729 15.80734 460.0 2.31 0.0
downstream pressure freestream zone 1

turbulence model spalart allmaras

implicit boundary on
dq limiter on

loads
   zone 1
   print totals zones lift frequency 10
   reference area 1
   reference length 1.0
   reference moment center 0.0 0.0 0.0
   subset i 33 337 j 1 1 k 1 1 force noslip
endloads

converge order 9
cycles 500
iterations per cycle 10 print frequency 5
cfl 5.0

end
